### User Story 1 - Reliable Error Handling (Priority: P1)

**Input**: User description: "Comprehensive code review and quality improvement for the existing production asset management system"**Input**: User description: "$ARGUMENTS"

As a system administrator or user, when I interact with any form in the KPP application, I should receive clear, actionable error messages in Croatian when something goes wrong, and the system should gracefully recover from errors without crashing or losing my data.



**Why this priority**: Production stability is critical. Unhandled exceptions cause crashes, data loss, and user frustration. This is the foundation for all other improvements.

